OL,3,GNEWSANew #1.5m centre opens on Infinity
OL,4,Atechnology park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new manufacturing hub has opened on a
OL,7,F200-acre advanced technology park being
OL,8,Fcreated in Derby.
OL,10,FThe new Infinity Prototype Centre (IPC)
OL,11,Fhas opened at the Infinity development
OL,12,Fin Sinfin. It is based inside the
OL,13,Fformer nuclear advanced manufacturing
OL,14,Fresearch centre at the site off
OL,15,FInfinity Park Way.
OL,17,FThe ribbon was cut at the IPC site on
OL,18,FMonday following a #1.5m investment
OL,19,Ffrom the office of East Midlands Mayor
OL,20,FClare Ward.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
