OL,3,GNEWSANew #1.5m centre opens on Infinity
OL,4,Atechnology park
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe IPC will offer services to
OL,7,Forganisations "across the nuclear
OL,8,Fsupply chain and wider advanced
OL,9,Fmanufacturing sector", said partner
OL,10,FDerby City Council.
